  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Enjaz Integrated Petrochemical Complex Project, through Fluor Corporation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will partially fund a feasibility study (FS) to evaluate the technical and economic feasibility of the Enjaz Integrated Petrochemical Complex Project to be located in the Suez Governorate in the Sokhna area in the Suez Canal Economical Zone (SE Zone). The FS will evaluate developing a petrochemical complex that would utilize natural gas from the newly discovered Zohr gas fields.</narrative>
  </description>
